[
  {
    "start": 7.06,
    "end": 11.3,
    "text": "Hey! Another Rap Sta Bam. Phone Memo here, also known as Babis."
  },
  {
    "start": 11.3,
    "end": 17.54,
    "text": "We're here in Nikaia Square, Mastabas, with Chozen. How's it going?"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.54,
    "end": 23.34,
    "text": "Good. He's an up-and-coming rapper from Crete, who's taken his rap to Thessaloniki."
  },
  {
    "start": 23.34,
    "end": 27.1,
    "text": "Rumour has it, Chozen, you've been spitting bars for the block since you were little."
  },
  {
    "start": 27.1,
    "end": 29.02,
    "text": "Yes, yes, exactly."
  },
  {
    "start": 29.02,
    "end": 31.66,
    "text": "Tell us, how young?"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.66,
    "end": 32.62,
    "text": "How young were you?"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.62,
    "end": 36.9,
    "text": "I'm interested, because I think people in Greece are still a little embarrassed about rap."
  },
  {
    "start": 36.9,
    "end": 39.22,
    "text": "I've been spitting bars for the block since I was twelve."
  },
  {
    "start": 39.22,
    "end": 39.7,
    "text": "Twelve?"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.7,
    "end": 45.34,
    "text": "Since twelve. Honestly, I wrote them at twelve and started spitting them at eighteen."
  },
  {
    "start": 45.34,
    "end": 50.18,
    "text": "Okay, so six years to mature before bringing it out."
  },
  {
    "start": 50.18,
    "end": 52.34,
    "text": "Okay, yes. Let's put it this way."
  },
  {
    "start": 52.34,
    "end": 58.3,
    "text": "Then your career starts. Not a career straight away, but I think it's growing into something big."
  },
  {
    "start": 58.3,
    "end": 60.18,
    "text": "At eighteen, definitely not. It wasn't a career then."
  },
  {
    "start": 60.18,
    "end": 61.94,
    "text": "I saw your first record came out in 2023."
  },
  {
    "start": 61.94,
    "end": 62.78,
    "text": "In ’23, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 62.78,
    "end": 65.5,
    "text": "Was that \"From Here to SKG\"?"
  },
  {
    "start": 65.5,
    "end": 65.94,
    "text": "No?"
  },
  {
    "start": 65.94,
    "end": 67.14,
    "text": "Yeah, \"From Here to SKG.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 67.14,
    "end": 67.46,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 67.46,
    "end": 69.26,
    "text": "\"From Here to SKG,\" my first EP."
  },
  {
    "start": 69.26,
    "end": 74.26,
    "text": "Basically, at seventeen or eighteen... Wait, let me take my hood off."
  },
  {
    "start": 74.26,
    "end": 80.42,
    "text": "At seventeen or eighteen, I left Therisos and Mastabas and moved to Thessaloniki."
  },
  {
    "start": 80.42,
    "end": 86.34,
    "text": "I've lived there five years now. That's why I called the EP \"From Here to SKG.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 86.34,
    "end": 86.74,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 86.74,
    "end": 88.42,
    "text": "It was that transition."
  },
  {
    "start": 88.42,
    "end": 89.58,
    "text": "Leaving here, going there."
  },
  {
    "start": 89.58,
    "end": 94.06,
    "text": "Is there a big difference between Heraklion's scene and Thessaloniki's?"
  },
  {
    "start": 94.06,
    "end": 96.9,
    "text": "There are huge differences between the two scenes."
  },
  {
    "start": 96.9,
    "end": 101.02,
    "text": "Not just the rappers, but the opportunities to grow as a rapper."
  },
  {
    "start": 101.02,
    "end": 105.06,
    "text": "Thessaloniki is the mother of rap in Greece."
  },
  {
    "start": 105.06,
    "end": 110.5,
    "text": "Everyone raps there, everyone raps really well. It's embedded in the culture."
  },
  {
    "start": 110.5,
    "end": 110.94,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 110.94,
    "end": 115.54,
    "text": "I don't know how big the scene is here, but it produces some gems."
  },
  {
    "start": 115.54,
    "end": 118.94,
    "text": "Crete and Heraklion produce great artists, good people."
  },
  {
    "start": 118.94,
    "end": 120.58,
    "text": "Do you think it's the mantinades and raki?"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.58,
    "end": 123.7,
    "text": "The mantinades and raki, yeah. That freestyle spirit!"
  },
  {
    "start": 123.7,
    "end": 128.02,
    "text": "What was your first encounter with rap? Not just Greek rap, rap in general."
  },
  {
    "start": 128.02,
    "end": 128.82,
    "text": "Generally?"
  },
  {
    "start": 128.82,
    "end": 130.62,
    "text": "In general. Your first encounter with rap."
  },
  {
    "start": 130.62,
    "end": 135.82,
    "text": "I had a CD, which must have been from Sporty or something."
  },
  {
    "start": 135.82,
    "end": 138.62,
    "text": "I didn't tell you this over coffee, because you'd asked differently."
  },
  {
    "start": 138.62,
    "end": 139.82,
    "text": "Yeah, that's right."
  },
  {
    "start": 139.82,
    "end": 146.06,
    "text": "The CD had the rap playing in Greece then. It was called \"Old School.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 146.06,
    "end": 152.5,
    "text": "I still have it. Back then, you'd play it in a DVD player,"
  },
  {
    "start": 152.5,
    "end": 158.62,
    "text": "which would just show \"Track 1,\" \"Track 2,\" and so on, without the artists' names."
  },
  {
    "start": 158.62,
    "end": 164.22,
    "text": "I listened without knowing who it was. Much later, I realised the CD had TXC on it."
  },
  {
    "start": 164.22,
    "end": 168.46,
    "text": "And Midenistis, with \"Afieromeno.\" I still remember it, even if I didn't know what it was."
  },
  {
    "start": 168.46,
    "end": 173.18,
    "text": "\"Let me bring us closer.\" That was the line, anyway."
  },
  {
    "start": 173.18,
    "end": 176.94,
    "text": "I was like, \"Okay, I fuck with this music!\""
  },
  {
    "start": 176.94,
    "end": 184.94,
    "text": "Sporty also had new music on the back pages, what young people were listening to."
  },
  {
    "start": 184.94,
    "end": 187.06,
    "text": "I was about ten then."
  },
  {
    "start": 187.06,
    "end": 194.5,
    "text": "And funny pictures: back when phones had buttons, you'd text to get a funny image."
  },
  {
    "start": 194.5,
    "end": 195.14,
    "text": "Yes, yes, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 195.14,
    "end": 195.98,
    "text": "Just random stuff."
  },
  {
    "start": 195.98,
    "end": 200.02,
    "text": "It featured Boreia Asteria and 12os Pithikos."
  },
  {
    "start": 200.02,
    "end": 207.14,
    "text": "I checked them out on YouTube, then got Thitis's \"Kommatia\" in the recommendations."
  },
  {
    "start": 207.14,
    "end": 209.9,
    "text": "One track after another. I thought, \"Whoa, this happens here?\""
  },
  {
    "start": 209.9,
    "end": 216.26,
    "text": "You were ten? Did you get a little older by the time you heard it? That was heavy."
  },
  {
    "start": 216.26,
    "end": 217.3,
    "text": "Yes, it was. Yes, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 217.3,
    "end": 219.46,
    "text": "Thitis's stuff was pretty hardcore."
  },
  {
    "start": 219.46,
    "end": 226.3,
    "text": "While I was discovering it, friends were too. They told me, \"Toquel's from Heraklion.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 226.3,
    "end": 233.34,
    "text": "I heard Toquel and was amazed he was from our city. Like listening to 50 in America, we listened to Toquel."
  },
  {
    "start": 233.34,
    "end": 243.74,
    "text": "Around eleven or twelve, I listened to Kanye West, Jay-Z, 50 Cent, and loads of Eminem."
  },
  {
    "start": 243.74,
    "end": 247.82,
    "text": "At 14 I felt like I was Slim Shady, bro. I felt like I was Slim Shady. I was leaving home, saying..."
  },
  {
    "start": 247.82,
    "end": 249.98,
    "text": "White T-shirt, jeans, nothing else!"
  },
  {
    "start": 249.98,
    "end": 250.54,
    "text": "Yes, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 250.54,
    "end": 252.02,
    "text": "“Mom, I'm leaving. I'm going to rap.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 252.02,
    "end": 254.22,
    "text": "I was out in the hood like... [imitates rapping]"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.34,
    "end": 257.22,
    "text": "You mention dreams in your tracks."
  },
  {
    "start": 257.22,
    "end": 257.74,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 257.74,
    "end": 261.34,
    "text": "Do you want to be a rapper? Something else? A rapper as well?"
  },
  {
    "start": 261.34,
    "end": 261.98,
    "text": "My dream..."
  },
  {
    "start": 261.98,
    "end": 264.22,
    "text": "Bro, I am a rapper. You get me? I'm a rapper."
  },
  {
    "start": 264.22,
    "end": 264.78,
    "text": "You are right."
  },
  {
    "start": 264.78,
    "end": 266.06,
    "text": "Do you want to be a rap star?"
  },
  {
    "start": 266.06,
    "end": 267.54,
    "text": "Yeah, I'm going to be a rap star, bro."
  },
  {
    "start": 267.54,
    "end": 268.06,
    "text": "Going to."
  },
  {
    "start": 268.06,
    "end": 268.66,
    "text": "Certainly."
  },
  {
    "start": 268.66,
    "end": 270.3,
    "text": "\"Going to\" is a very good choice of words."
  },
  {
    "start": 270.3,
    "end": 271.22,
    "text": "Uh, yeah bro."
  },
  {
    "start": 271.22,
    "end": 271.78,
    "text": "Well done."
  },
  {
    "start": 271.78,
    "end": 275.46,
    "text": "My aim, bro, is to put Heraklion on the map."
  },
  {
    "start": 275.46,
    "end": 278.94,
    "text": "My neighbourhood too: Therisos, Mastabas, and the others."
  },
  {
    "start": 278.94,
    "end": 281.86,
    "text": "Like we said about the block and starting young..."
  },
  {
    "start": 281.86,
    "end": 286.02,
    "text": "I do it because there are some people here who love me, I love them and..."
  },
  {
    "start": 286.02,
    "end": 287.3,
    "text": "So you've got support?"
  },
  {
    "start": 287.3,
    "end": 288.54,
    "text": "Yes, man, of course."
  },
  {
    "start": 288.54,
    "end": 292.82,
    "text": "I've got that neighbourhood support not many people have."
  },
  {
    "start": 292.82,
    "end": 296.02,
    "text": "You go outside, and it's, \"Chozen, I heard your tracks. Awesome!\""
  },
  {
    "start": 296.02,
    "end": 297.1,
    "text": "Yeah, that's my people, bro."
  },
  {
    "start": 297.1,
    "end": 298.14,
    "text": "Your people. Always your people."
  },
  {
    "start": 298.14,
    "end": 299.62,
    "text": "They hear the tracks before release."
  },
  {
    "start": 299.62,
    "end": 300.06,
    "text": "Before they come out."
  },
  {
    "start": 300.06,
    "end": 300.66,
    "text": "Got it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 300.66,
    "end": 302.5,
    "text": "They know all my songs before they're released."
  },
  {
    "start": 302.5,
    "end": 303.02,
    "text": "That's how it should be."
  },
  {
    "start": 303.02,
    "end": 303.46,
    "text": "This."
  },
  {
    "start": 303.46,
    "end": 305.62,
    "text": "You need people to share your troubles or your tracks with."
  },
  {
    "start": 305.62,
    "end": 308.74,
    "text": "Anything I release goes through here first, through Therisos."
  },
  {
    "start": 308.74,
    "end": 309.14,
    "text": "That's how it should be."
  },
  {
    "start": 309.14,
    "end": 310.94,
    "text": "They check it out, and we say, \"Let's go!\""
  },
  {
    "start": 310.94,
    "end": 311.58,
    "text": "Nice."
  },
  {
    "start": 311.58,
    "end": 317.98,
    "text": "Here in Heraklion, in Mastabas... I imagine you know this park well."
  },
  {
    "start": 317.98,
    "end": 318.58,
    "text": "Yes, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 318.58,
    "end": 321.1,
    "text": "You said this is your bench. You're on familiar ground."
  },
  {
    "start": 321.1,
    "end": 322.78,
    "text": "Your brother's bench, you said?"
  },
  {
    "start": 322.78,
    "end": 324.74,
    "text": "Your brother's bench."
  },
  {
    "start": 324.74,
    "end": 327.66,
    "text": "I've got two or three. I move between them!"
  },
  {
    "start": 327.66,
    "end": 328.78,
    "text": "So many blocks from such a young age!"
  },
  {
    "start": 328.78,
    "end": 329.54,
    "text": "Yes, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 329.54,
    "end": 331.82,
    "text": "And you also have various collaborations."
  },
  {
    "start": 331.82,
    "end": 333.82,
    "text": "I listened to \"Big Mac\" with Tset."
  },
  {
    "start": 333.82,
    "end": 334.46,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 334.46,
    "end": 335.34,
    "text": "Do you have..."
  },
  {
    "start": 335.34,
    "end": 336.38,
    "text": "Shout-out to Tset."
  },
  {
    "start": 336.38,
    "end": 337.62,
    "text": "In general, in your album..."
  },
  {
    "start": 337.62,
    "end": 341.42,
    "text": "Merjo, Dylan Hyde, lots of producers."
  },
  {
    "start": 341.42,
    "end": 342.86,
    "text": "How did you come into contact with all of them?"
  },
  {
    "start": 342.86,
    "end": 344.02,
    "text": "Look, with most..."
  },
  {
    "start": 344.02,
    "end": 344.82,
    "text": "I will tell you the other thing."
  },
  {
    "start": 344.82,
    "end": 345.26,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 345.26,
    "end": 349.34,
    "text": "You definitely met producers and rappers in Thessaloniki."
  },
  {
    "start": 349.34,
    "end": 349.66,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 349.66,
    "end": 353.46,
    "text": "Was it as easy here, or did you go up there,"
  },
  {
    "start": 353.46,
    "end": 356.22,
    "text": "meet everyone, and get welcomed in?"
  },
  {
    "start": 356.22,
    "end": 357.58,
    "text": "Was it easy for you?"
  },
  {
    "start": 357.58,
    "end": 358.78,
    "text": "Yes, I'll tell you, I'll tell you."
  },
  {
    "start": 358.78,
    "end": 363.78,
    "text": "When I went to SKG, I thought, \"I have to find my team.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 363.78,
    "end": 364.74,
    "text": "Your team too, right."
  },
  {
    "start": 364.74,
    "end": 366.26,
    "text": "It happened organically, you know?"
  },
  {
    "start": 366.26,
    "end": 366.86,
    "text": "Organically."
  },
  {
    "start": 366.86,
    "end": 370.34,
    "text": "I'm talking about my team in Thessaloniki."
  },
  {
    "start": 370.34,
    "end": 372.02,
    "text": "Merjo's part of my team."
  },
  {
    "start": 372.02,
    "end": 375.1,
    "text": "But in general, because I am very social, let's say..."
  },
  {
    "start": 375.1,
    "end": 380.18,
    "text": "I'm talking to... I'm really looking for who's next up, who's working, who's got talent."
  },
  {
    "start": 380.18,
    "end": 381.46,
    "text": "Being social counts."
  },
  {
    "start": 381.46,
    "end": 381.98,
    "text": "This."
  },
  {
    "start": 381.98,
    "end": 385.06,
    "text": "Not social just for the sake of it. I'm looking..."
  },
  {
    "start": 385.06,
    "end": 387.22,
    "text": "Being able to build relationships matters."
  },
  {
    "start": 387.22,
    "end": 389.54,
    "text": "Exactly. I'm looking around."
  },
  {
    "start": 389.54,
    "end": 393.26,
    "text": "With the right attitude, the right people come naturally."
  },
  {
    "start": 393.26,
    "end": 395.78,
    "text": "You meet someone and click."
  },
  {
    "start": 395.78,
    "end": 398.9,
    "text": "Tell me about your first recording."
  },
  {
    "start": 398.9,
    "end": 403.26,
    "text": "Like I said, my first beat"
  },
  {
    "start": 403.26,
    "end": 406.38,
    "text": "was made with this huge, square, white monitor,"
  },
  {
    "start": 406.38,
    "end": 411.66,
    "text": "my aunt's stereo, and a PC running Windows Vista."
  },
  {
    "start": 411.66,
    "end": 413.58,
    "text": "And FL Studio 12."
  },
  {
    "start": 413.58,
    "end": 417.58,
    "text": "My first beat was just a sample with a loop over it."
  },
  {
    "start": 417.58,
    "end": 419.5,
    "text": "You had that setup too!"
  },
  {
    "start": 419.5,
    "end": 421.54,
    "text": "What was the original Chozen like?"
  },
  {
    "start": 421.54,
    "end": 423.02,
    "text": "Chozen without the capital letters!"
  },
  {
    "start": 424.02,
    "end": 425.26,
    "text": "Chozen before Chozen."
  },
  {
    "start": 425.26,
    "end": 426.3,
    "text": "At first, I rapped in English."
  },
  {
    "start": 426.3,
    "end": 426.94,
    "text": "In English?"
  },
  {
    "start": 426.94,
    "end": 428.02,
    "text": "Yeah, in English at first."
  },
  {
    "start": 428.02,
    "end": 429.98,
    "text": "You were indeed Slim Shady."
  },
  {
    "start": 429.98,
    "end": 435.34,
    "text": "I said I started spitting at seventeen or eighteen."
  },
  {
    "start": 435.34,
    "end": 439.02,
    "text": "A friend and I were hanging out, listening to loads of Travis Scott, saying,"
  },
  {
    "start": 439.02,
    "end": 444.26,
    "text": "\"We'll rap in English, go worldwide!\""
  },
  {
    "start": 444.26,
    "end": 446.82,
    "text": "\"Bro, in ten years I'll work with Kanye!\""
  },
  {
    "start": 447.82,
    "end": 449.94,
    "text": "All that, you get the idea."
  },
  {
    "start": 449.94,
    "end": 455.66,
    "text": "At his place, with a random USB microphone and his laptop."
  },
  {
    "start": 455.66,
    "end": 461.42,
    "text": "Those little speakers they give primary schools,"
  },
  {
    "start": 461.42,
    "end": 465.58,
    "text": "beside the computers. Tiny speakers like that."
  },
  {
    "start": 465.58,
    "end": 468.74,
    "text": "And I just rapped in English, bro. That was it."
  },
  {
    "start": 468.74,
    "end": 474.02,
    "text": "After the first two English recordings, I said, \"Okay, Greek first.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 474.02,
    "end": 480.06,
    "text": "I went to Add Manson's studio in Gazi. Those were the first serious recordings."
  },
  {
    "start": 480.06,
    "end": 484.1,
    "text": "That's quite a distance! Did you take the bus? A whole hour's journey!"
  },
  {
    "start": 484.1,
    "end": 491.78,
    "text": "By bike, bro. A friend and I once cycled from here to Gazi in the rain."
  },
  {
    "start": 491.78,
    "end": 496.58,
    "text": "It was the most try-hard thing I'd ever done! No idea why. I could've just not gone."
  },
  {
    "start": 496.58,
    "end": 498.1,
    "text": "Respect to the Chozen of that time!"
  },
  {
    "start": 498.1,
    "end": 501.18,
    "text": "Crazy grind. I don't know what drove me."
  },
  {
    "start": 501.18,
    "end": 508.46,
    "text": "Now, after all that grind, you're older. Ten years have passed."
  },
  {
    "start": 508.46,
    "end": 516.46,
    "text": "You'll be rapping with Kanye soon! Tell me your favourite rapper and your favourite line."
  },
  {
    "start": 516.46,
    "end": 522.38,
    "text": "The line doesn't have to be by that rapper. It can even be one of yours."
  },
  {
    "start": 522.38,
    "end": 525.42,
    "text": "This is very hard bro. Very difficult."
  },
  {
    "start": 525.42,
    "end": 528.26,
    "text": "What does the Chozen of 2026 have to say?"
  },
  {
    "start": 528.26,
    "end": 539.94,
    "text": "As a kid, Eminem, Toquel, Fifty. But now, the musical mastermind for me is Kanye West."
  },
  {
    "start": 539.94,
    "end": 540.74,
    "text": "I'm ending it there!"
  },
  {
    "start": 540.74,
    "end": 542.34,
    "text": "I'm not telling you that, okay..."
  },
  {
    "start": 542.34,
    "end": 546.82,
    "text": "The controversies aside, you mean the artist, the art itself."
  },
  {
    "start": 546.82,
    "end": 550.62,
    "text": "Yeah. Think \"Graduation\" Kanye, you know?"
  },
  {
    "start": 550.62,
    "end": 551.74,
    "text": "Yes, \"Graduation\"."
  },
  {
    "start": 551.74,
    "end": 563.62,
    "text": "He's just dropped \"Bully.\" I still like him most, but it changes. Future, Playboi Carti, Drake all the time."
  },
  {
    "start": 563.62,
    "end": 565.34,
    "text": "My favourite rapper changes all the time."
  },
  {
    "start": 565.34,
    "end": 568.82,
    "text": "Right now it's Draft Day and Concrete Boys."
  },
  {
    "start": 568.82,
    "end": 569.5,
    "text": "Shall I tell you something?"
  },
  {
    "start": 569.5,
    "end": 570.5,
    "text": "Lil Yachty, say."
  },
  {
    "start": 570.5,
    "end": 580.86,
    "text": "When our tastes change, we grow too. You hear music and bring elements into your own work if you like them."
  },
  {
    "start": 580.86,
    "end": 587.14,
    "text": "But ultimately it's the lyrics that stay with you. Give me your favourite line, then let's see yours."
  },
  {
    "start": 587.14,
    "end": 590.02,
    "text": "I'll disappoint you there: we don't have those school speakers!"
  },
  {
    "start": 590.02,
    "end": 595.02,
    "text": "No worries. Favourite line... Greek or international?"
  },
  {
    "start": 595.02,
    "end": 595.9,
    "text": "Whatever you like."
  },
  {
    "start": 595.9,
    "end": 601.86,
    "text": "Right now, \"Born to lose, but we're all winners,\" by Light. That came to mind."
  },
  {
    "start": 601.86,
    "end": 607.98,
    "text": "When Light's \"Zougkla\" came out, a friend and I listened to it constantly."
  },
  {
    "start": 607.98,
    "end": 608.94,
    "text": "Strong stuff."
  },
  {
    "start": 608.94,
    "end": 609.86,
    "text": "It was very good."
  },
  {
    "start": 609.86,
    "end": 610.54,
    "text": "Really strong."
  },
  {
    "start": 610.54,
    "end": 612.7,
    "text": "So, let's do some work."
  },
  {
    "start": 612.7,
    "end": 613.54,
    "text": "Are you ready?"
  },
  {
    "start": 613.54,
    "end": 614.46,
    "text": "Let's go, yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 614.46,
    "end": 615.62,
    "text": "Let's head to the rooftop."
  },
  {
    "start": 615.62,
    "end": 616.38,
    "text": "Let's go."
  },
  {
    "start": 616.38,
    "end": 635.23,
    "text": "Let's go."
  },
  {
    "start": 635.23,
    "end": 638.11,
    "text": "We're here, set up, sorted. The rooftop..."
  },
  {
    "start": 638.11,
    "end": 638.75,
    "text": "Incredible."
  },
  {
    "start": 638.75,
    "end": 641.75,
    "text": "At my place, on the rooftop. That's the setup."
  },
  {
    "start": 641.75,
    "end": 643.79,
    "text": "And what beat are you feeling today?"
  },
  {
    "start": 643.79,
    "end": 649.03,
    "text": "I want you to play a little, and we'll add things as you go. You get me?"
  },
  {
    "start": 649.03,
    "end": 649.43,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 649.43,
    "end": 651.55,
    "text": "Exactly. Try some samples."
  },
  {
    "start": 651.55,
    "end": 656.99,
    "text": "Let's not overthink it. Listen to sounds, play them. Start with drums."
  },
  {
    "start": 656.99,
    "end": 663.39,
    "text": "Then synths, a lead, whatever we like, and bass to match."
  },
  {
    "start": 663.39,
    "end": 663.71,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 663.71,
    "end": 666.27,
    "text": "That's enough to start with. Then the bass."
  },
  {
    "start": 666.27,
    "end": 669.03,
    "text": "Yes. Two things. First, we didn't connect the mic."
  },
  {
    "start": 669.03,
    "end": 670.03,
    "text": "The mic will come in next."
  },
  {
    "start": 670.03,
    "end": 670.87,
    "text": "Oh, okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 670.87,
    "end": 673.43,
    "text": "Because first we make the beat and then the recording comes in."
  },
  {
    "start": 673.43,
    "end": 673.95,
    "text": "Okay, this."
  },
  {
    "start": 673.95,
    "end": 676.07,
    "text": "I want you to write at the same time."
  },
  {
    "start": 676.07,
    "end": 676.83,
    "text": "What sort of sound?"
  },
  {
    "start": 676.83,
    "end": 677.55,
    "text": "Trap vibes?"
  },
  {
    "start": 677.55,
    "end": 678.83,
    "text": "Not trap—scratch that."
  },
  {
    "start": 678.83,
    "end": 679.63,
    "text": "Just something quick."
  },
  {
    "start": 679.63,
    "end": 680.27,
    "text": "And fast."
  },
  {
    "start": 680.27,
    "end": 681.47,
    "text": "Something special, fast."
  },
  {
    "start": 681.47,
    "end": 688.43,
    "text": "Something close to trap, fast and relaxed. Something around 120 BPM, definitely."
  },
  {
    "start": 688.43,
    "end": 691.59,
    "text": "That is, 120 BPM is the sweet spot. You will see it."
  },
  {
    "start": 691.59,
    "end": 694.99,
    "text": "We'll put in quick hi-hats and build on top."
  },
  {
    "start": 694.99,
    "end": 695.35,
    "text": "Good."
  },
  {
    "start": 695.35,
    "end": 695.67,
    "text": "Perfect."
  },
  {
    "start": 695.67,
    "end": 695.95,
    "text": "Ready?"
  },
  {
    "start": 695.95,
    "end": 696.63,
    "text": "Let's go."
  },
  {
    "start": 696.63,
    "end": 704.19,
    "text": "Well, I'll give you the first sequence, which we'll name \"Main\", because here we play with loops."
  },
  {
    "start": 704.19,
    "end": 707.35,
    "text": "We'll call it \"Main.\" How many bars?"
  },
  {
    "start": 707.35,
    "end": 710.91,
    "text": "Four bars for the main sequence, then loop it."
  },
  {
    "start": 710.91,
    "end": 711.59,
    "text": "Yes, yes, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 711.59,
    "end": 712.71,
    "text": "Or should I make it eight bars?"
  },
  {
    "start": 712.71,
    "end": 713.55,
    "text": "Make it eight bars."
  },
  {
    "start": 713.55,
    "end": 714.19,
    "text": "Eight bars."
  },
  {
    "start": 715.23,
    "end": 716.79,
    "text": "Do we like this hi-hat?"
  },
  {
    "start": 716.79,
    "end": 717.75,
    "text": "This."
  },
  {
    "start": 717.75,
    "end": 718.71,
    "text": "This, perhaps."
  },
  {
    "start": 718.71,
    "end": 720.43,
    "text": "Yes, maybe that."
  },
  {
    "start": 720.43,
    "end": 723.67,
    "text": "Let's record a first pass."
  },
  {
    "start": 723.67,
    "end": 730.11,
    "text": "We've got the option of layering over this. That's what I want here."
  },
  {
    "start": 730.11,
    "end": 733.23,
    "text": "And let it go somehow..."
  },
  {
    "start": 733.23,
    "end": 734.23,
    "text": "Or do you want it faster?"
  },
  {
    "start": 734.23,
    "end": 735.47,
    "text": "Do it, and we'll see."
  },
  {
    "start": 735.47,
    "end": 736.47,
    "text": "Build it."
  },
  {
    "start": 736.47,
    "end": 737.47,
    "text": "We'll see."
  },
  {
    "start": 739.83,
    "end": 742.51,
    "text": "I'm not that into this sample."
  },
  {
    "start": 742.51,
    "end": 743.31,
    "text": "This?"
  },
  {
    "start": 743.31,
    "end": 743.91,
    "text": "We won't use it."
  },
  {
    "start": 743.91,
    "end": 744.79,
    "text": "Oh, okay, okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 745.47,
    "end": 746.23,
    "text": "We like that."
  },
  {
    "start": 746.23,
    "end": 747.59,
    "text": "The..."
  },
  {
    "start": 747.59,
    "end": 748.43,
    "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 748.43,
    "end": 748.91,
    "text": "Yeah, yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 748.91,
    "end": 751.74,
    "text": "Or this."
  },
  {
    "start": 751.74,
    "end": 752.1,
    "text": "To go..."
  },
  {
    "start": 752.1,
    "end": 752.54,
    "text": "Play."
  },
  {
    "start": 752.54,
    "end": 756.85,
    "text": "Boom, boom."
  },
  {
    "start": 756.85,
    "end": 757.49,
    "text": "This, this."
  },
  {
    "start": 757.49,
    "end": 758.61,
    "text": "This, huh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 758.61,
    "end": 759.45,
    "text": "Good."
  },
  {
    "start": 759.53,
    "end": 770.4,
    "text": "Perhaps another."
  },
  {
    "start": 770.4,
    "end": 771.4,
    "text": "A little more sub-bass."
  },
  {
    "start": 771.4,
    "end": 781.59,
    "text": "But before the bass we will put..."
  },
  {
    "start": 783.15,
    "end": 784.35,
    "text": "Oh, wait."
  },
  {
    "start": 786.42,
    "end": 788.18,
    "text": "Do we want something like this or do we want something more..."
  },
  {
    "start": 790.2,
    "end": 791.12,
    "text": "Make it go like..."
  },
  {
    "start": 792.12,
    "end": 793.12,
    "text": "Oh, and that's nice."
  },
  {
    "start": 799.24,
    "end": 799.96,
    "text": "I like this."
  },
  {
    "start": 799.96,
    "end": 800.68,
    "text": "Something like that."
  },
  {
    "start": 800.68,
    "end": 801.68,
    "text": "I like it, I like it."
  },
  {
    "start": 803.64,
    "end": 805.8,
    "text": "E minor's my go-to, by the way."
  },
  {
    "start": 805.8,
    "end": 808.68,
    "text": "I often end up writing in E minor."
  },
  {
    "start": 808.68,
    "end": 811.16,
    "text": "Then you just play; E minor is mostly white keys."
  },
  {
    "start": 811.16,
    "end": 812.8,
    "text": "At some point it can go..."
  },
  {
    "start": 812.8,
    "end": 848.18,
    "text": "Then maybe... There's a lot of room for a solo."
  },
  {
    "start": 848.18,
    "end": 850.3,
    "text": "That room for a solo gets me excited."
  },
  {
    "start": 850.3,
    "end": 851.3,
    "text": "Oh wait."
  },
  {
    "start": 851.3,
    "end": 854.58,
    "text": "If I find a nice lead..."
  },
  {
    "start": 859.99,
    "end": 889.71,
    "text": "Should we put one in like that?"
  },
  {
    "start": 891.11,
    "end": 892.11,
    "text": "I wasn't listening."
  },
  {
    "start": 892.11,
    "end": 893.51,
    "text": "Because I was listening to the bass."
  },
  {
    "start": 893.51,
    "end": 894.51,
    "text": "Obviously."
  },
  {
    "start": 895.27,
    "end": 896.27,
    "text": "Then it's GTA!"
  },
  {
    "start": 905.13,
    "end": 906.49,
    "text": "We'll play a solo afterwards."
  },
  {
    "start": 906.49,
    "end": 908.37,
    "text": "Oh, wait."
  },
  {
    "start": 910.37,
    "end": 911.89,
    "text": "If I do an E minor like this..."
  },
  {
    "start": 924.73,
    "end": 925.29,
    "text": "Another one."
  },
  {
    "start": 925.29,
    "end": 926.29,
    "text": "Another one like that."
  },
  {
    "start": 927.69,
    "end": 928.29,
    "text": "Where is it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 928.29,
    "end": 929.29,
    "text": "Copy sequence."
  },
  {
    "start": 932.94,
    "end": 934.94,
    "text": "Nice! That could've been a clarinet."
  },
  {
    "start": 934.94,
    "end": 950.77,
    "text": "These are the bass sounds it has."
  },
  {
    "start": 950.77,
    "end": 951.77,
    "text": "So."
  },
  {
    "start": 951.77,
    "end": 952.77,
    "text": "I know what we're gonna do, man."
  },
  {
    "start": 952.77,
    "end": 953.77,
    "text": "Let's play violins, like normal people!"
  },
  {
    "start": 953.77,
    "end": 954.77,
    "text": "As everyone does."
  },
  {
    "start": 954.77,
    "end": 956.77,
    "text": "And we will put these here."
  },
  {
    "start": 956.77,
    "end": 958.77,
    "text": "So we want something more..."
  },
  {
    "start": 958.77,
    "end": 959.77,
    "text": "Fresh, just like that."
  },
  {
    "start": 959.77,
    "end": 969.03,
    "text": "This'll go at the end."
  },
  {
    "start": 969.03,
    "end": 973.55,
    "text": "FX."
  },
  {
    "start": 973.55,
    "end": 977.37,
    "text": "Give me some words..."
  },
  {
    "start": 977.37,
    "end": 987.88,
    "text": "You'll like the tracks too, though."
  },
  {
    "start": 987.88,
    "end": 989.88,
    "text": "No, I've only got bars right now."
  },
  {
    "start": 989.88,
    "end": 991.88,
    "text": "Home is not a prison."
  },
  {
    "start": 991.88,
    "end": 992.88,
    "text": "Have bars, man!"
  },
  {
    "start": 992.88,
    "end": 993.88,
    "text": "Whatever."
  },
  {
    "start": 993.88,
    "end": 994.88,
    "text": "One time someone told me..."
  },
  {
    "start": 994.88,
    "end": 995.88,
    "text": "Say it, say it."
  },
  {
    "start": 995.88,
    "end": 996.88,
    "text": "I wanted filters."
  },
  {
    "start": 996.88,
    "end": 997.88,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 997.88,
    "end": 998.88,
    "text": "This friend goes..."
  },
  {
    "start": 998.88,
    "end": 1000.88,
    "text": "I tell him: \"Bring a filter, bro.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 1000.88,
    "end": 1001.88,
    "text": "He says to me: \"Take a bar.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 1001.88,
    "end": 1002.88,
    "text": "\"I've got bars.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 1002.88,
    "end": 1003.88,
    "text": "\"I don't have filters, bro.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 1004.88,
    "end": 1005.88,
    "text": "Do you get it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1005.88,
    "end": 1007.88,
    "text": "I've got a million bars in here."
  },
  {
    "start": 1007.88,
    "end": 1009.88,
    "text": "That costs a hundred thousand, bro!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1009.88,
    "end": 1010.88,
    "text": "Be aware."
  },
  {
    "start": 1010.88,
    "end": 1011.88,
    "text": "No, two hundred."
  },
  {
    "start": 1017.88,
    "end": 1019.88,
    "text": "Put it in, bro. It needs a bell!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1019.88,
    "end": 1020.88,
    "text": "It needs a bell."
  },
  {
    "start": 1020.88,
    "end": 1021.88,
    "text": "I have."
  },
  {
    "start": 1021.88,
    "end": 1023.88,
    "text": "If you don't have one, get it. You can..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1027.88,
    "end": 1039.45,
    "text": "I really want it to have one now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1039.45,
    "end": 1040.45,
    "text": "Wait."
  },
  {
    "start": 1040.45,
    "end": 1042.45,
    "text": "I'll look for a bell here now, fuck it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1043.45,
    "end": 1045.45,
    "text": "First off, do we like this bass?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1045.45,
    "end": 1046.45,
    "text": "That's it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1046.45,
    "end": 1047.45,
    "text": "Wait, before the bell."
  },
  {
    "start": 1047.45,
    "end": 1048.45,
    "text": "That's it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1048.45,
    "end": 1049.45,
    "text": "The bell."
  },
  {
    "start": 1050.45,
    "end": 1051.45,
    "text": "This is not."
  },
  {
    "start": 1051.45,
    "end": 1052.45,
    "text": "Where's the simple one?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1052.45,
    "end": 1053.45,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1053.45,
    "end": 1055.45,
    "text": "There's already a lot of space."
  },
  {
    "start": 1055.45,
    "end": 1056.45,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1056.45,
    "end": 1057.45,
    "text": "Indeed, indeed."
  },
  {
    "start": 1057.45,
    "end": 1060.45,
    "text": "If you want, give it a..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1060.45,
    "end": 1066.08,
    "text": "Okay, okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 1066.08,
    "end": 1072.41,
    "text": "I found something here, but I don't know what it is."
  },
  {
    "start": 1073.41,
    "end": 1076.41,
    "text": "Great, we've got it. Into the pool."
  },
  {
    "start": 1076.41,
    "end": 1078.41,
    "text": "This one's in C, but we played in E, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1079.41,
    "end": 1080.41,
    "text": "Oh, oh, we've played."
  },
  {
    "start": 1080.41,
    "end": 1081.41,
    "text": "Good thing we kept one chord."
  },
  {
    "start": 1081.41,
    "end": 1083.41,
    "text": "I was wondering what we'd play... E."
  },
  {
    "start": 1083.41,
    "end": 1086.23,
    "text": "Now we need to tune it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1086.23,
    "end": 1088.29,
    "text": "Let's get our sample from here."
  },
  {
    "start": 1088.29,
    "end": 1089.69,
    "text": "It tells you, that's why."
  },
  {
    "start": 1089.69,
    "end": 1090.87,
    "text": "It is labeled."
  },
  {
    "start": 1090.87,
    "end": 1094.43,
    "text": "Natural minor."
  },
  {
    "start": 1094.43,
    "end": 1096.43,
    "text": "This will blow your mind:"
  },
  {
    "start": 1096.43,
    "end": 1098.89,
    "text": "Because you can put whatever root you want on it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1098.89,
    "end": 1101.73,
    "text": "the scale, and where it starts."
  },
  {
    "start": 1101.73,
    "end": 1112.04,
    "text": "And we go to our mix."
  },
  {
    "start": 1112.04,
    "end": 1113.86,
    "text": "Turn the bell down a little."
  },
  {
    "start": 1113.86,
    "end": 1116.24,
    "text": "Add an effect, some reverb."
  },
  {
    "start": 1116.24,
    "end": 1123.36,
    "text": "I think we are fine."
  },
  {
    "start": 1123.36,
    "end": 1124.98,
    "text": "How do you see it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1125.32,
    "end": 1126.68,
    "text": "[censored]"
  },
  {
    "start": 1126.68,
    "end": 1127.5,
    "text": "We are here."
  },
  {
    "start": 1127.5,
    "end": 1135.6,
    "text": "I don't have my tag inside."
  },
  {
    "start": 1135.6,
    "end": 1138.1,
    "text": "You haven't? Load it in."
  },
  {
    "start": 1138.1,
    "end": 1139.5,
    "text": "Loading it now would take a little while."
  },
  {
    "start": 1139.5,
    "end": 1142,
    "text": "Not long. I'll download it from Drive."
  },
  {
    "start": 1142,
    "end": 1143.64,
    "text": "Put it on the pad."
  },
  {
    "start": 1143.64,
    "end": 1145.24,
    "text": "Load it in! [censored]"
  },
  {
    "start": 1145.24,
    "end": 1148,
    "text": "Phone Memo's beside you: Guitar Hero! [thanks, Tzimos]"
  },
  {
    "start": 1148,
    "end": 1150.94,
    "text": "I'll make you an intro now,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1150.94,
    "end": 1155.78,
    "text": "without the synths at first. They come in later."
  },
  {
    "start": 1155.78,
    "end": 1160.28,
    "text": "And the bass from it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1160.28,
    "end": 1161.78,
    "text": "We've finished that part too,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1161.78,
    "end": 1163.34,
    "text": "and we've made..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1163.36,
    "end": 1167.2,
    "text": "The outro. And if we wanted to now, we would go to song mode."
  },
  {
    "start": 1167.2,
    "end": 1168.3,
    "text": "Then we'd take it back."
  },
  {
    "start": 1168.3,
    "end": 1170.64,
    "text": "But we'll leave it for now. It'll do the job."
  },
  {
    "start": 1170.64,
    "end": 1172.02,
    "text": "I'll loop the main sequence."
  },
  {
    "start": 1172.02,
    "end": 1175.38,
    "text": "Three thousand flows have gone through my head!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1175.38,
    "end": 1181.44,
    "text": "Sounds like a fart!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1181.44,
    "end": 1183.02,
    "text": "Maybe more slowly, maybe with some effect."
  },
  {
    "start": 1183.02,
    "end": 1184.8,
    "text": "It'll come in slower. We need to hear it first."
  },
  {
    "start": 1184.8,
    "end": 1188.92,
    "text": "It remains a little strange."
  },
  {
    "start": 1188.92,
    "end": 1198.57,
    "text": "There's a mistake here. Give me a moment to fix it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1198.57,
    "end": 1199.33,
    "text": "We make a substitution."
  },
  {
    "start": 1199.35,
    "end": 1201.35,
    "text": "See? We'll take this properly."
  },
  {
    "start": 1201.35,
    "end": 1202.57,
    "text": "Here we go."
  },
  {
    "start": 1202.57,
    "end": 1203.87,
    "text": "Come on!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1203.87,
    "end": 1213.94,
    "text": "Come on, go, before I say something about your aunt the dancer!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1213.94,
    "end": 1215.76,
    "text": "Drop it over the recording too."
  },
  {
    "start": 1215.76,
    "end": 1217.26,
    "text": "Are you sure? Yes, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1217.26,
    "end": 1217.64,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 1217.64,
    "end": 1219.96,
    "text": "Let's record it in there now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1219.96,
    "end": 1222.56,
    "text": "Want a variation there for the recording?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1222.56,
    "end": 1223.02,
    "text": "Yes, of course."
  },
  {
    "start": 1223.02,
    "end": 1228.18,
    "text": "See what's about to happen."
  },
  {
    "start": 1228.18,
    "end": 1229.6,
    "text": "One-point-six for a verse."
  },
  {
    "start": 1229.6,
    "end": 1231.12,
    "text": "The sound is fresh, I flex."
  },
  {
    "start": 1231.12,
    "end": 1233.02,
    "text": "Out with the team again, looking classy."
  },
  {
    "start": 1233.02,
    "end": 1234.92,
    "text": "This. Nice verse."
  },
  {
    "start": 1234.92,
    "end": 1235.58,
    "text": "I like it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1235.58,
    "end": 1236.76,
    "text": "What do you say?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1236.76,
    "end": 1237.58,
    "text": "Yes, nice."
  },
  {
    "start": 1237.58,
    "end": 1240.8,
    "text": "Chill. Eight relaxed bars, then..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1240.8,
    "end": 1242,
    "text": "A little pause."
  },
  {
    "start": 1242,
    "end": 1244.86,
    "text": "The beat comes in and builds. Fuck, it's good."
  },
  {
    "start": 1244.86,
    "end": 1246.78,
    "text": "And if you see it, go here to the arrangement."
  },
  {
    "start": 1246.78,
    "end": 1247.94,
    "text": "It's all there for you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1247.94,
    "end": 1249.6,
    "text": "Everything everything."
  },
  {
    "start": 1249.6,
    "end": 1252.94,
    "text": "We can cut it, then record."
  },
  {
    "start": 1252.94,
    "end": 1254.8,
    "text": "Shall I export it and move it over?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1254.8,
    "end": 1256.08,
    "text": "Let's do it. Time to record."
  },
  {
    "start": 1256.08,
    "end": 1256.78,
    "text": "See you in a bit."
  },
  {
    "start": 1256.78,
    "end": 1261.1,
    "text": "Speak into it; we can hear you."
  },
  {
    "start": 1261.1,
    "end": 1262.5,
    "text": "I don't know if you can hear me from outside."
  },
  {
    "start": 1262.5,
    "end": 1264.26,
    "text": "One, two, one, two. Okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 1264.26,
    "end": 1265.62,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "start": 1265.62,
    "end": 1268,
    "text": "Wait, wouldn't we have...? Sorry."
  },
  {
    "start": 1268,
    "end": 1268.9,
    "text": "Have what?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1268.9,
    "end": 1270.58,
    "text": "Latency."
  },
  {
    "start": 1270.58,
    "end": 1272.48,
    "text": "No. One, two. No latency."
  },
  {
    "start": 1272.48,
    "end": 1274.02,
    "text": "No latency or [censored], right?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1274.02,
    "end": 1275.56,
    "text": "Want me to leave the metronome on?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1275.56,
    "end": 1276.9,
    "text": "No, turn it off."
  },
  {
    "start": 1276.9,
    "end": 1279.16,
    "text": "Perfect. And are you ready?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1279.16,
    "end": 1280.5,
    "text": "Let's take a take."
  },
  {
    "start": 1280.5,
    "end": 1282.04,
    "text": "It is now also heard from the speakers."
  },
  {
    "start": 1282.04,
    "end": 1283.02,
    "text": "Want me to turn them off?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1283.02,
    "end": 1284.42,
    "text": "No."
  },
  {
    "start": 1284.42,
    "end": 1287.5,
    "text": "I thought about hearing myself without headphones,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1287.5,
    "end": 1289.8,
    "text": "But I also like it with headphones."
  },
  {
    "start": 1289.8,
    "end": 1292.86,
    "text": "Let's do a recorded take like this."
  },
  {
    "start": 1292.86,
    "end": 1299.75,
    "text": "Can you hear it too now?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1299.75,
    "end": 1300.25,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1300.25,
    "end": 1301.75,
    "text": "You can hear it too."
  },
  {
    "start": 1301.75,
    "end": 1303.75,
    "text": "Say, \"See what's about to happen.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 1303.75,
    "end": 1305.75,
    "text": "Say, \"See what's about to happen.\""
  },
  {
    "start": 1305.75,
    "end": 1307.75,
    "text": "24/7."
  },
  {
    "start": 1307.75,
    "end": 1309.75,
    "text": "Yeah, yeah, hey, hey."
  },
  {
    "start": 1309.75,
    "end": 1311.75,
    "text": "Say you see what's about to happen."
  },
  {
    "start": 1311.75,
    "end": 1313.75,
    "text": "Only real ones stick around."
  },
  {
    "start": 1313.75,
    "end": 1315.75,
    "text": "Others come looking for bread,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1315.75,
    "end": 1317.75,
    "text": "Like pigeons in the middle of the Bronx."
  },
  {
    "start": 1317.75,
    "end": 1319.75,
    "text": "Hey, I thought you were a bro."
  },
  {
    "start": 1319.75,
    "end": 1321.75,
    "text": "Phew, didn't expect that."
  },
  {
    "start": 1321.75,
    "end": 1323.75,
    "text": "Yeah, fuck it, I want the euros."
  },
  {
    "start": 1323.75,
    "end": 1325.75,
    "text": "Fuck it, I want the euros."
  },
  {
    "start": 1325.75,
    "end": 1327.75,
    "text": "I spend them with people who don't want me for that."
  },
  {
    "start": 1327.75,
    "end": 1329.75,
    "text": "I did it alone, just for the block."
  },
  {
    "start": 1329.75,
    "end": 1331.75,
    "text": "From the basement to the 2-8-10."
  },
  {
    "start": 1331.75,
    "end": 1333.75,
    "text": "Now ten for a drop,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1333.75,
    "end": 1335.75,
    "text": "one-point-six for the verse."
  },
  {
    "start": 1335.75,
    "end": 1337.75,
    "text": "The sound is fresh; I flex."
  },
  {
    "start": 1337.75,
    "end": 1339.75,
    "text": "Two chains aren't enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 1339.75,
    "end": 1341.75,
    "text": "Two watches aren't enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 1341.75,
    "end": 1343.75,
    "text": "If you're a rapper, where's your neighbourhood?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1343.75,
    "end": 1345.75,
    "text": "You've got no bars; Mum's laughing."
  },
  {
    "start": 1345.75,
    "end": 1347.75,
    "text": "Thank God we're having a good time."
  },
  {
    "start": 1347.75,
    "end": 1349.75,
    "text": "Like MAD, I'm true and bad!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1349.75,
    "end": 1351.75,
    "text": "If I do deals, they'll never know."
  },
  {
    "start": 1351.75,
    "end": 1353.75,
    "text": "Out with the team again, looking classy."
  },
  {
    "start": 1353.75,
    "end": 1355.75,
    "text": "Cruising with the gangos, then out for poché."
  },
  {
    "start": 1355.75,
    "end": 1357.75,
    "text": "They didn't see what I saw; they never felt the pain."
  },
  {
    "start": 1357.75,
    "end": 1359.75,
    "text": "I go pow-pow, yeah, turn up with... yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 1359.75,
    "end": 1361.75,
    "text": "He gives all the YAYO, that's how we live, yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": 1361.75,
    "end": 1363.75,
    "text": "Two gangos ask, \"Where you at, Chozen?\""
  },
  {
    "start": 1363.75,
    "end": 1365.75,
    "text": "\"I'll hit the spot in ten.\" I'm a jet."
  },
  {
    "start": 1365.75,
    "end": 1367.75,
    "text": "Pow!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1367.75,
    "end": 1369.75,
    "text": "Pow! That was it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1369.75,
    "end": 1371.75,
    "text": "What do you think?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1373.75,
    "end": 1375.75,
    "text": "Now we're here, hitting it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1375.75,
    "end": 1377.75,
    "text": "Sounds great bro. It sounds perfect."
  },
  {
    "start": 1377.75,
    "end": 1379.75,
    "text": "It's my first time recording outdoors."
  },
  {
    "start": 1379.75,
    "end": 1381.75,
    "text": "If I do deals, they'll never know."
  },
  {
    "start": 1381.75,
    "end": 1383.75,
    "text": "Where you at, Chozen?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1383.75,
    "end": 1385.75,
    "text": "\"I'll hit the spot in ten.\" I'm a jet."
  },
  {
    "start": 1385.75,
    "end": 1387.75,
    "text": "Pow!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1387.75,
    "end": 1389.75,
    "text": "Chilled out and comfortable."
  },
  {
    "start": 1389.75,
    "end": 1391.75,
    "text": "I'm not going up; I'm going forward."
  },
  {
    "start": 1391.75,
    "end": 1393.75,
    "text": "Is there anything better in life?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1393.75,
    "end": 1395.75,
    "text": "Come over here."
  },
  {
    "start": 1395.75,
    "end": 1397.75,
    "text": "Basically, it wouldn't make noise with this mic."
  },
  {
    "start": 1397.75,
    "end": 1399.75,
    "text": "Say it bro."
  },
  {
    "start": 1399.75,
    "end": 1401.75,
    "text": "The whole of Troy could turn up here..."
  },
  {
    "start": 1401.75,
    "end": 1403.75,
    "text": "you know, whatever."
  },
  {
    "start": 1403.75,
    "end": 1405.75,
    "text": "All two of them!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1405.75,
    "end": 1407.75,
    "text": "You wouldn't hear them. The mic's that good."
  },
  {
    "start": 1407.75,
    "end": 1409.75,
    "text": "Chozen would still sound clear."
  },
  {
    "start": 1409.75,
    "end": 1411.75,
    "text": "Clear."
  },
  {
    "start": 1411.75,
    "end": 1413.75,
    "text": "I spend them with people who don't want me for that."
  },
  {
    "start": 1413.75,
    "end": 1415.75,
    "text": "\"I'll hit the spot in ten.\" I'm a jet."
  },
  {
    "start": 1415.75,
    "end": 1417.75,
    "text": "Pow! That was it, bro."
  },
  {
    "start": 1417.75,
    "end": 1419.75,
    "text": "That's it. Rap Sta Bam."
  },
  {
    "start": 1419.75,
    "end": 1421.75,
    "text": "Chozen."
  },
  {
    "start": 1421.75,
    "end": 1423.75,
    "text": "We're having fun, guys!"
  },
  {
    "start": 1423.75,
    "end": 1425.75,
    "text": "A lot of fun."
  }
]
